{"sections":[{"slug":"束","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"束"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">束</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"束"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">束</span> (gerbe) <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的一种特殊的对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">仅包含某一个阶数的非平凡同伦信息</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">抽象定义</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">束就是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/∞-意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> $1$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":" $0$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/连通性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">连通</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对象</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一般地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">定义</span> $n$-<strong><span lang=\"zh\">束</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span> $(n-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/连通性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">连通</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对象</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">使用</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/相对","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">相对观点</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">对于态射</span> $Y\\to X$, <span lang=\"zh\">若其在</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/俯意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">俯意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中为</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">我们也可称之为</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">一般的束没有</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/整体截面","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">整体</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span>) <strong><span lang=\"zh\">点</span></strong>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">由定义</span>, <strong><span lang=\"zh\">带点</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束等同于</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Eilenberg–MacLane空间","text":"Eilenberg–MacLane <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">又称为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">平凡</span></strong> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span> (trivial $n$-gerbe).</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">通过景定义</span></h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"}},{"Plain":" $(\\mathcal C,J)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">束</span></strong> (gerbe) <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">群胚取值的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/景上的层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层</span>"}},{"Plain":" $F \\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathsf{Ani}_{\\leq 1}$, <span lang=\"zh\">满足</span></p>\n<ul>\n<li>($(-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/连通性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">连通性</span>"}},{"Plain":") $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">局部非空</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即存在终对象的覆盖</span> $(U_i)$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span> $F(U_i)$ <span lang=\"zh\">非空</span>;</li>\n<li>($0$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/连通性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">连通性</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> $U\\in\\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">任意两个元素</span> $x,y\\in F(U)$ <span lang=\"zh\">局部同构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">即存在</span> $U$ <span lang=\"zh\">的覆盖使得</span> $x,y$ <span lang=\"zh\">在其上的限制</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">拉回</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">同构</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">性质</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span>, $x,y\\colon * \\to F$ <span lang=\"zh\">为两个点</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">考虑拉回</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccc}\r\n    *\\times_F * &amp; \\to &amp; * \\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow {\\scriptsize{x}}\\!\\!\\! \\\\\r\n    * &amp; \\underset{y}{\\to} &amp; F,\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> $*\\times_F *$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $(n-1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">由群控制的束</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">类似于</span> Eilenberg–MacLane <span lang=\"zh\">空间由一个</span> (Abel) <span lang=\"zh\">群控制</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">束有时也可由群控制</span>.</p>\n<p>$n=1$ <span lang=\"zh\">情形</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal{C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> $0$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Local":{"url":"/群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":", <span lang=\"zh\">定义由</span> $G$ <strong><span lang=\"zh\">控制</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">束是一个</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">束带有如下结构</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>(<span lang=\"zh\">抽象表述</span>) $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $1$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶整体</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同伦群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">与</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">的同构</span> $\\pi_1(F)\\simeq G_F := G\\times F$;</li>\n<li>(<span lang=\"zh\">传统表述</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/景","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">景</span>"}},{"Plain":" $(\\mathcal C,J)$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/层意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">定义</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> $U\\in\\mathcal C$, <span lang=\"zh\">任意</span> $x\\in F(U)$, <span lang=\"zh\">有函子性的同构</span> $G(U) \\simeq \\operatorname{Aut}_{F(U)}(x)$.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">注</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">假设</span> $\\pi_1(F)\\simeq G_F$, <span lang=\"zh\">即</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> $x\\in F$” (<span lang=\"zh\">只能在局部上或在</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象的内语言","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">内语言</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">中解读</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> $\\pi_1(F,x)\\simeq G$, <span lang=\"zh\">由</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断性</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">实际上有</span> $\\Omega(F,x)\\simeq G$; <span lang=\"zh\">那么</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">外部语言</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">对任意</span> $x\\in F(U)$ <span lang=\"zh\">就有</span> $\\operatorname{Aut}_{F(U)}(x)\\simeq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal{C}_{/U}}(U,\\Omega (F\\times U,x)) \\simeq G(U)$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">注</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $1$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span> $F$, <span lang=\"zh\">上面的群</span> $G$ <span lang=\"zh\">不一定存在</span>.</p>\n<p>$n\\geq 2$ <span lang=\"zh\">情形</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $n\\geq 2$, $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal{C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> $0$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":" Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">定义由</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">控制的</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束为一个</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">带有一个同构</span> $\\pi_n(F) \\simeq A\\times F$.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">直观上</span>, $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">在每一点处的</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">阶</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/同伦群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">同伦群</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">均为</span> $A$. <span lang=\"zh\">注意这不能推出</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">同构于</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Eilenberg–MacLane空间","text":"Eilenberg–MacLane <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{B}^n A$. <span lang=\"zh\">因为</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">甚至可以没有整体的点</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">记</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">控制的</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束的范畴为</span> $\\mathsf{Gerb}_n^A(\\mathcal{C})$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">为意象</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span> ($n\\geq 2$), <span lang=\"zh\">则存在</span> $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> $0$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span> $A$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得</span>\n$$\r\n\\pi_n (F) \\simeq A \\times F.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">由于</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $(n-1)$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/连通性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">连通</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">对象</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">函子</span> $F\\times (-) \\colon \\mathcal{C} \\to\\mathcal{C}_{/F}$ <span lang=\"zh\">诱导了</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/俯意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">俯意象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $(n-2)$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断部分的等价</span>\n$$\r\n\\mathcal{C}_{\\leq n-2} \\simeq (\\mathcal{C}_{/F})_{\\leq n-2}.\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">两边的</span> $0$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断部分等价</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">从而</span> $\\pi_n (F) \\in \\mathsf{Ab}((\\mathcal{C}_{/F})_{\\leq 0})$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应于</span> $A\\in\\mathsf{Ab}(\\mathcal{C}_{\\leq 0})$.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">平凡性与局部平凡性</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $0$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断群</span> $A$, <span lang=\"zh\">由</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">控制的带点</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束即为</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Eilenberg–MacLane空间","text":"Eilenberg–MacLane <span lang=\"zh\">对象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $K(A,n)=\\mathbf{B}^n A$. <span lang=\"zh\">定义一个</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">控制的</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span> $F$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">平凡化</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">为其</span> ("},{"Local":{"url":"/整体截面","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">整体</span>"}},{"Plain":") <span lang=\"zh\">点</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">也等同于其到</span> $\\mathbf{B}^n A$ <span lang=\"zh\">的等价</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> $0$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">对于</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">控制的</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span> $\\tilde{X} \\to X$, <span lang=\"zh\">若有</span> $\\mathcal C_{/X}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的同构</span> $\\tilde{X} \\simeq X\\times\\mathbf{B}^{n}A$, <span lang=\"zh\">则称</span> $\\tilde{X}\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">平凡</span></strong> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">称同构</span> $\\tilde{X} \\simeq X\\times\\mathbf{B}^{n}A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span> $\\tilde{X}$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> <strong><span lang=\"zh\">平凡化</span></strong>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">若</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span> $\\tilde{X}\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">有截面</span> $s\\colon X\\to \\tilde{X}$, <span lang=\"zh\">则它是平凡</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span>.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span> $\\tilde{X} \\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">在</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">局部</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">有截面</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">即沿某个</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象中的满射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">满射</span>"}},{"Plain":" $U\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的拉回有截面</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">从而为平凡</span> $n$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span>).</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">与上同调的关系</span></h3>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">命题</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">为</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">意象</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal{C}$ <span lang=\"zh\">中的</span> $0$-<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span> Abel <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>, $n\\geq 2$. <span lang=\"zh\">则有</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/生象","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">生象</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的等价</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal{C}}(X,\\mathbf{B}^n A) \\simeq \\mathsf{Gerb}_{n-1}^A(\\mathcal C_{/X}),\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">将</span> $X\\to\\mathbf{B}^n A$ <span lang=\"zh\">对应到拉回</span> $(n-1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span>\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccc}\r\n    \\tilde{X} &amp; \\to &amp; * \\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\n    X &amp; \\to &amp; \\mathbf{B}^n A.\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">换言之</span>, $*\\to \\mathbf{B}^n A$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">万有</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">控制的</span> $(n-1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">特别地</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">取</span> $0$-"},{"Local":{"url":"/截断性","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">截断</span>"}},{"Plain":"), $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">系数</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/上同调","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">上同调</span>"}},{"Plain":" $H^n(X,A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">等同于</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">控制的</span> $(n-1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">束的等价类</span>.</p>\n<p><em><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></em>. <span lang=\"zh\">要证的是对任意由</span> $A$ <span lang=\"zh\">控制的</span> $(n-1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span> $\\tilde{X}\\to X$, <span lang=\"zh\">存在唯一如上的拉回图</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">采用从局部到整体的方法</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">首先</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">要证明的结论关于</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">局部</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">也就是对任意</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/意象中的满射","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">满射</span>"}},{"Plain":" $U\\to X$, <span lang=\"zh\">只要结论对拉回</span> $(n-1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span> $\\tilde{X}\\times_X U \\to U$ <span lang=\"zh\">成立</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">就有结论对</span> $(n-1)$-<span lang=\"zh\">束</span> $\\tilde{X}\\to X$ <span lang=\"zh\">成立</span>.</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">扭层</span></h3>\n<p>(<span lang=\"zh\">集合值的</span>) "},{"Local":{"url":"/层","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">层</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">可以视为平凡束的截面</span>; <span lang=\"zh\">一般地</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">每一个束的截面给出一种</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">扭层</span></strong><span lang=\"zh\">的概念</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">用传统的观点即一个</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">粘合条件被</span> $2$-<span lang=\"zh\">上圈扭过</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的层</span>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}